  <widget class="QTextBrowser" name="txbAyuda">
   <property name="geometry">
    <rect>
     <x>490</x>
     <y>20</y>
     <width>311</width>
     <height>291</height>
    </rect>
   </property>
   <property name="html">
    <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Generar GML para catastro desde capa de Poligonos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:10pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;Permite generar un fichero GML en formato INSPIRE de CATASTRO a partir de una capa de Polígonos, completa o solo de sus elementos seleccionados. Cada parcela catastral remitida debe tener dos valores obligatorios en sendos campos de la tabla tipo TEXTO, conteniendo el &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;LOCALID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;y &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;NAMESPACE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; de cada parcela, los nombres de estos campos pueden ser de cualquier tipo, pudiéndolos seleccionar el usuario.&lt;br /&gt;El sistema tratará de localizar los campos &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;RC14&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; (para el localid) y &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;CAT_NMSPC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; (para el NAMESPACE).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;DATOS DE ENTRADA:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;CAPA DE ENTRADA:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; Capa de POLÍGONOS cargada en la Tabla de Contenido (TOC).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;   SOLO ELEMENTOS SELECCIONADOS:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;ACTIVADO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;,  generará el GML de las parcelas seleccionadas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;FICHERO GML SALIDA:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; directorio y nombre de fichero de salida GML; se puede componer con el botón de la derecha. El sistema guarda el último directorio y nobre de fichero empleados.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;CAMPO LOCALID:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;permite seleccionar el campo que contiene el valor de LOCALID, al seleccionarlo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; El sistema dará preferencia si localiza un campo llamado &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;RC14&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; (RECOMENDADO).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;DATOS EN LOCALID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;LOCALID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;: El LOCALID es el identificador de la parcela y debe ser &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;único&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;, es decir, no puede haber dos parcelas con el mismo identificador en los ficheros GML que se usen para obtener un IVGA (1).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;Si se trata de una parcela ya existente en la cartografía catastral su valor será siempre la &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;REFERENCIA CATASTRAL (RC)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; de la finca que le asignó la DGC, y estará compuesta por &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;14 caracteres&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;Si se trata de una parcela de nueva creación, puede asignarse un identificador con el nombre que se quiera (siempre que sea único en la tabla).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;CAMPO NAMESPACE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; permite seleccionar el campo que contiene el valor de NAMESPACE.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;El sistema dará preferencia si localiza un campo llamado &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;CAT_NMSPC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; (RECOMENDADO).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;DATOS EN NAMESPACE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;NAMESPACE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt;Es el espacio de nombres de la parcela, e identifica si la parcela ya existe en la cartografía catastral, o es de nueva creación (por ejemplo, como resultado de una reparcelación o de una segregación). Si es una parcela ya existente en la cartografía catastral tendrá el valor '&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;ES.SDGC.CP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt;. Si es una parcela nueva se debe poner '&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;ES.LOCAL.CP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;Si el valor del &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;NAMESPACE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; es '&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;ES.SDGC.CP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;', entonces &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;LOCALID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; debe contener &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;obligatoriamente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; un valor correcto y único de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;REFERENCIA CATASTRAL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; de 14 dígitos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;DECIMALES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; Se pueden condicionar los formatos de salida del GML, tanto para el valor AREA, como para las COORDENADAS de los nodos. Se recomiendan &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;2 decimales para AREA y 3 para COORDENADAS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;COMPROBACIONES EN LA CREACIÓN DEL GML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;El programa analiza las parcelas detectando:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;* Existencia de Parcelas con el mismo LOCALID (LOCALID duplicado)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;* Parcelas con NAMESPACE= '&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; text-decoration: underline; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;ES.SDGC.CP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;' cuyo LOCALID no exista en Catastro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;* Parcelas con NAMESPACE= '&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; text-decoration: underline; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;ES.LOCAL.CP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;' cuyo LOCALID exista ya en Catastro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;* Parcelas con geometria &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;multipolígono &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;(no admiidas)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;* Eliminación de nodos duplicados consecutivos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;CONTROLES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Comprobar LOCALID repetidos al inicio:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt; Previamente a la generación, se pueden intentar detectar &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;LOCALID repetidos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Revisar RRCC identicas a origen:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt;Se analizan las parcelas con NAMESPACE &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; '&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;ES.SDGC.CP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;', analizando si tienen una coincidencia absoluta de geometría con la parcela descargada de catastro.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;(1) IVGA:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt; Informe de VALIDACIÓN GRÁFICA ALTERNATIVA que emite catastro para validar las geometrías remitidas. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Más INFO:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.catastro.minhap.es/ayuda/vga/ayuda_vga.htm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; text-decoration: underline; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;Validación de una Representación Gráfica Alternativa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.catastro.minhap.es/esp/faqs_catastro_registro.asp&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; text-decoration: underline; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;Preguntas frecuentes acerca de la Coordinación Catastro-Registro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
   </property>
  </widget>
  <widget class="QToolButton" name="btnSeleccionfich">
   <property name="geometry">
    <rect>
     <x>445</x>
     <y>120</y>
     <width>35</width>
     <height>22</height>
    </rect>
   </property>
   <property name="text">
